ss="ffcell" style="width:9%;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td></tr><tr style="height:15px;background-color:#cceeff"><td style="vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px"><strong>Shareholder&#8217;s Equity:</strong></p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td class="ffcell" style="width:9%;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td class="ffcell" style="width:9%;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td></tr><tr style="height:15px;background-color:#ffffff"><td style="vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">Preferred Stock, no par value, 30,000,000 shares authorized, and no shares outstanding as of March 31, 2023.</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td class="ffcell" style="width:9%;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new ro