><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td></tr><tr style="height:15px;background-color:#cceeff"><td style="vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">OTHER INCOME</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td class="ffcell" style="width:9%;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;">179,283</td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td class="ffcell" style="width:9%;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;">66,491</td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td></tr><tr style="height:15px;background-color:#ffffff"><td><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td class="ffcell" style="width:9%;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p></td><td style="width:1%;white-space: nowrap;"><p style="fon