 issued and outstanding, common stock is <ix:nonFraction id="fid_484" contextRef="AsOf2021-12-31" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="Shares">171,218,152</ix:nonFraction> shares.</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:justify;">&#160;</p><table style="border-spacing:0;font:10pt times new roman;width:100%" cellpadding="0"><tbody><tr style="height:15px"><td class="hpbhr">&#160;</td></tr><tr style="height:15px"><td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1px solid; TEXT-INDENT: 0px;text-align:center;">F-35</td></tr><tr style="height:15px"><td><p style="page-break-after: always"></p></td></tr><tr style="height:15px"><td><em><a href="#toc2">Table of Contents</a></em></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;"><strong>BIONEXUS GENE LAB CORP.</strong></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;"><strong>NOTES TO CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</strong></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;"><strong>FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED MARCH 31, 2023, 2022, YEAR ENDE</strong><strong>D DECEMBER 31, 2022 AND 2021</strong></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;"><strong>&#160;(Currency expressed in United States Dollars (&#8220;US$&#8221;))</strong></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:center;"><strong>(Unaudited)</strong></p><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px">&#160;</p><ix:nonNumeric id="fid_784" contextRef="From2023-01-01to2023-03-31" name="us-gaap:SegmentReportingDisclosureTextBlock" escape="true" continuedAt="cont_320c3f"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:times new roman;margin:0px"><strong>NOTE 1